=== components/AuditPanel.tsx
     1	// Audit, top-right. Opens on what the current page is about, for the selected checkpoint only: on Evidence, what
     2	// entered the data and when; on Structure, when the agent ran each stage and every AI step. "Everything" shows both
     3	// checkpoints, each row tagged; history from before the checkpoint rebuild (the old wave-based app) is kept in the
     4	// append-only trail but only shown there on request. Styled like the rest of the HUD: a 28px pill like the filter chips, a glass sheet like the
     5	// inspector. Inside, the trail runs down one hairline rail: stage runs are milestones, every other row is a step.
     6	// Identical steps of one stream (same action, stage and checkpoint, no gap over 10 minutes; the agent classifies 20
     7	// comments per call) fold into one row with their totals and can be opened, even when another run's steps interleave. Chips on top show or hide who acted.
     8	import { useEffect, useMemo, useState } from "react";
